<ul class="mntl-sc-block__list mntl-sc-block-universal-comparison-list__list">
<li><p>Includes private messaging features.</p></li>
<li><p>Excellent spam protection.</p></li>
<li><p>Includes 15 GB of space for emails and other files.</p></li>
<li><p>Integrates closely with other Google services.</p></li>
