</div>
<ul class="mntl-sc-block__list mntl-sc-block-universal-comparison-list__list">
<li><p>Tons of email storage space.</p></li>
<li><p>Lets you make free disposable email addresses.</p></li>
<li><p>Includes a built-in GIF database.</p></li>
<li><p>Yahoo Calendar integration directly within the email area is user-friendly.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="mntl-sc-block__wrapper mntl-sc-block-universal-comparison-list__wrapper">
<div class="mntl-sc-block__list-heading-wrapper mntl-sc-block-universal-comparison-list__list-heading-wrapper">
